@startuml RuleLifecycle
title Rule lifecycle
[*] --> Draft : analyst creates
Draft --> Review : submit
Review --> Draft : reject
Review --> Approved : manager + director
Approved --> Active : effective_date
Active --> Deprecated : newer version live
Deprecated --> Retired : expiry
Active --> Active : rollback to N-1
note right of Active
  Shadow / A-B is a
  parallel Active flag
  that does not affect
  customer action.
end note
@enduml
